Package: HeartFill
Title: Novelty Fill Patterns, Mascot Points and DNA Error Bars for 'ggplot2'
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Alexander", "Molin", email = "alexander.karl.molin@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Adds novelty fill patterns (hearts, stars, flowers, butterflies,
    cats, dogs, unicorns, sugar beets, computers, repeated text and a
    recolourable hand-drawn mascot) to 'ggpattern' geoms such as
    geom_col_pattern(), plus two 'ggplot2' geoms: geom_viri() draws the mascot
    as scatterplot points and geom_errorbar_dna() draws error bars as a DNA
    double helix.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/alexandermolin/HeartFill
BugReports: https://github.com/alexandermolin/HeartFill/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: ggplot2, grid, grDevices, gridpattern, png
Suggests: ggpattern
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
